# Overlay surfaces

Source: [`docs/work-dashboard-design-spec.md`](../../docs/work-dashboard-design-spec.md) §13.

Floating chrome uses `.overlay` or `bg-surface-overlay` (solid hex). Carbon `$overlay` is the modal scrim only (`bg-backdrop`).

```tsx
// Wrong: no fill, invented class
<Tooltip.Popup className="tooltip-bg border border-border shadow-overlay">

// Wrong: scrim as the card
<Tooltip.Popup className="bg-backdrop">

// Right
<Tooltip.Popup className="overlay rounded-section p-3 shadow-overlay">
```

Done when page or table text cannot be read through the popup.
